<title>USA: Eastman Kodak Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Eastman Kodak Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.49		    $0.80</p>
<p> Net			 16,000		  275,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,417,000		4,191,000</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 3.82		   $ 3.67</p>
<p> Net		    1,288,000		1,252,000</p>
<p> Revs		  16,244,000	     15,269,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate for Q4 $1.12</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate annual $4.44</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings results above for both the quarter and year include restructuring costs and charges from discontinued operations. Not including such charges, earnings for the year were $1.52 billion, or $4.50 per share, and for the fourth quarter earnings were $395 million, or $1.19 per share.</p>
</text>
